        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIXn8vDNMHj6dGQpee1layEr2ctSBCpRIcqMEhc0HdaXNegDw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "freshness and quality is incredible! always going back there for the service and the knowledge of the owner. Its not cheap but the prices are very fair for the quality of the products! would recommend anytime to anyone!!!",
        "time": 1641648418,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Joan Regan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106387590544653671493/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJe9v9Y67UiNODHPDjl2mZiiffCAnctyP-dNq7AMzxRIRuugA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Staff was exceptional not only showing me their wares but also showing me how💕to find the directions on my phone coming from Cornwall. I will definitely go there again and buy more lobster!!",
        "time": 1749787525,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Koni",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112959035842527193401/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIHJha9avrJxyopTm_A7Ai6gZYJLo4yq4WcW7vCRO0xI-8kiWM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Overall, I would say that this fish store is very convenient, especially because it is the only one in the area. They have an adequate selection of fresh whole fish, which is great for those looking to cook seafood at home. In my experience, I have never encountered buying bad fish from this store. However, I did notice that the store does not have a lot of turnover, which can be concerning when it comes to guaranteeing freshness, especially considering the higher prices.",
        "time": 1705234900,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nick Antonelli",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100103166936463959472/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ31Xkq3SNMplxPjFnbl78C3LYScZxCabdxFbrYN5fXoNDYpg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Amazing products and great service! I've been there twice in the past 2 weeks for Sushi grade salmon. Its so fresh and tastes great. The owner made other suggestions and I can't wait until the next time I go.\nHighly recommend.",
        "time": 1646084571,
        "translated": false
      }
